      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RICKY BOBBY (3) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 366m behind Nobby (20.22) in a Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Should be very hard to beat this time. ORLANDO BEACH (2) showed good speed off a low draw and there throughout but run over late when 6th over 366m at this track in a Restricted WIN. Has a good record here at this journey. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Cannot be underestimated. HE'S DELIRIOUS (1) had a low draw latest where he found trouble and fell over 390m at Q Lakeside. Key chance on best form. MYONA COUNTESS (8) is likely to have admirers.",
